  "display_title": "How to Serve a Vampire",
  "description": "Raised on the streets, Alec’s day job is conning unsuspecting gamblers out of their hard-earned cash. But when his latest mark turns out to be a criminal-hunting vampire, Alec is caught up in dangerous political intrigue that could shake the nation. If they can keep their hands off each other long enough to plot, maybe this duo can overthrow their corrupt king, rescue vampire-kind from a dark contract, and fall in love along the way. If not, they’ll probably both end up dead… \n\n(Source: Tapas) \n\n*Note: The R15 version has 31 chapters while the R19 has 34.*",
